 slingshot and spend time on land even though he hails from a culture steeped in the sea.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.8}],"value":6.8,"age":"N/A"},"episode_id":8480,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}